WEBVTT

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:07.069
The Inbox brings comments and reviews together, so none go unanswered. In this video, you’ll reply to a review.

00:00:08.094 --> 00:00:17.566
Open Social, and choose Inbox. It brings in comments on the posts Worklynq published, and your Google reviews, and checks for new ones every fifteen minutes.

00:00:18.589 --> 00:00:25.245
At the top: what’s waiting, how many are unhappy, how many you’ve replied to, and how fast you usually reply.

00:00:26.276 --> 00:00:36.324
Open one, and AI suggests a reply in your brand voice. Edit it, and send it from Worklynq. An unhappy review can become a ticket, so someone follows it up.
